      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَشَأَ</span></b> , (O, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَشَاَ</span></b> , (K,) [inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَشْءٌ</span>;] as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افشأ</span></b> ; <i>He magnified himself;</i> or <i>behaved
proudly,</i> or <i>haughtily:</i> (O, K:) [or <i>he gloried,</i>
or <i>boasted:</i> for] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَشْءُ</span> is from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَخْرُ</span>, (Ibn-Buzurj,
O,) [or] <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَخْرُ</span>. (K.)

